line 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 39, 40, 41, 42, 43, 44 type: by-design spec §Excluded-Features there is no `undefined`, so a field a normalized union adds is optional `null` where tsc writes `?: undefined`, and the array literal already holds the normalized union where tsc normalizes only on widening
